" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"7:123\" name=\"Features strip\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:124\" name=\"High Quality · crafted from top materials (Icon_Trophy) Warranty Protection · Over 2 years (Icon_Guarantee) Free Shipping · Order over $75 (Icon_Shipping) 24 / 7 Support · Dedicated support (Icon_Support)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:125\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"5143\" width=\"1312\" height=\"332\">\n      <text id=\"7:126\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:127\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n        <frame id=\"7:128\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"7:129\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:130\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #000000, Volkhov and Poppins • Media: photos, avatars, sign-in logos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:131\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"281\">\n          <text id=\"7:132\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:133\" name=\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, sale and discount, rating, stock / urgency, links, error / disabled • Type scale (which levels use Volkhov), spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current nav item, current tab, current slide, selected size / color / view, sold out, checked, focused field, current page, cart count • Headers, footers, hero collage, brand strip, countdown, deal slider, tabs, product cards, collection banner, feature strip, Instagram strip, testimonial cards, newsletter, filters, gallery, pickers, stepper, mini cart, cart table, checkout form, order summary, auth cards • How photos are cropped and placed\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:134\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"5523\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"7:135\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:136\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"7:137\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current nav, tabs, selected options, sold out, cart count)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"7:138\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 11 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4989fa14-2e7d-4d0d-bbb8-4573dd6d6ae6","uuid":"3b9f3c8b-37b0-41d6-ad8f-2b9e473143fd","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:49:07.204Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"5868\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"FASCO — fashion store website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design a fashion e-commerce website: land on the home page, browse the shop, open a product, add it to the cart, review the cart, check out, and sign up, sign in or recover an account. Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the avatars, the sign-in logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3285\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3196\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"796\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Discover deals, new arrivals and the brand.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Brands: Minimog · Retrolie · Brook · Learts · Vagabond (as wordmarks) • Collection banner: Photo_Collection with item labels “Flat Cap” · “Cotton Shirt” · “Suspender” · “Leather Shoes” · “Men Collection” · “Classic Gentleman” · “DESCRIPTION” · copy (see DATA) · “Size:” M · $100.00 · “Buy Now” • Deals Of The Month: “Deals Of The Month” · copy (see DATA) · “Buy Now” · “Hurry, Before It’s Too Late!” · countdown 02 Days · 06 Hr · 05 Mins · 30 Sec · deal slides Photo_Deal_1, Photo_Deal_2, Photo_Deal_3 · current slide card “01 — Spring Sale” · “30% OFF” · previous / next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) · slide indicator: 4 slides, current 1 • Features: High Quality · Warranty Protection · Free Shipping · 24 / 7 Support, each with icon and line (see DATA) • Footer: “FASCO” · Support Center · Invoicing · Contract · Careers · Blog · FAQs · “Copyright © 2022 FASCO. All Rights Reserved.” • Header: “FASCO”