w: left: sort \"Best selling ▾\" (border box h44) ; right: view grid icon (active black box) / list icon. Then main row: filters sidebar w 280 + products grid 3×3 (cards: photo h 380, name, price (+old price strikethrough), sold out badge on photo for Linen-blend Shirt). Pagination centered: 1 (active) 2 3 › . Then collection banner, features, instagram, newsletter, store footer.\n\nWait must-include order for 02 includes Collection banner, Features, Instagram, Newsletter, Footer. Fine.\n\nFilters sidebar: \"Filters\" Volkhov 24; Size: boxes S M L XL (boxes 40×40, M maybe default? no current specified — plain); Colors: swatches row(s) 8-10 color circles; Prices: rows $0-$50 etc (text rows w/ checkbox? just rows); Brands: Minimog Retrolie Brook Learts Vagabond Abby; Collections: All products / Best sellers / New arrivals / Accessories; Tags: chips row wrap: Fashion Hats Sandal Belt Bags Sneaker Denim Sunglasses Beachwear.\n\n03_Product: header(store, current Products, badge1? — badge count 1 appears on 04-06; on 03 before add-to-cart no badge. Brief header for 03 says cart icon (no count mentioned) — navigation structure says cart shows count 1 on 04–06. So 03 no badge.) Gallery left: main photo Photo_Denim_Jacket_Blue_2 (w 560 h 660) + thumbnail column (6 thumbs 84×84, first = lilac? order: Lilac, Blue_1, Blue_2, Blue_3, Black_1, Black_2; selected thumb = Blue_2 with black border). Right column: breadcrumb? not required. \"FASCO\" small brand, \"Denim Jacket\" Volkhov 36, stars + (3), price row: $39.00 + old $59.00 strike + \"Save 33%\" red chip. Size: M — boxes M(selected black) L XL XXL. Color: Blue — swatches blue(selected ring) black lilac. Qty stepper + \"Add to cart\" black button wide. Urgency: eye icon + \"24 people are viewing this right now\"; \"Hurry up! Sale ends in:\" + timer 00:05:59:47 red; stock bar \"Only 9 item(s) left in stock!\" with progress bar (red fill ~20%). Delivery box: Icon_Delivery \"Estimated Delivery: Jul 30 - Aug 03\"; Icon_Returns \"Free Shipping & Returns: On all orders over $75\"; \"Guarantee safe & secure checkout\" small centered with border box. Actions row: Compare / Ask a question / Share with icons.\nThen \"People Also Loved\" deal slider (copy override), collection banner, features, newsletter, footer.\n\nWait — People Also Loved includes countdown etc. Reuse DealSlider component with title/copy overrides.\n\n04_Mini_Cart: full frame = dimmed 03 product page behind (semi-transparent black overlay over a simplified/inactive product page) + right drawer w 480 full height: \"Shopping Cart\" + close icon; progress: \"Buy $36.00 more and get Free Shipping\" + progress bar; item row: photo 96×96, \"Denim Jacket\", \"Color : Blue\", $39.00, qty stepper −01+; checkbox \"For $10.00 please wrap the product\" unchecked; \"Subtotal\" $39.00; \"Checkout\" black button; \"View Cart\" ghost/underline button.\nBehind: I need the 03_Product page \"inactive\". Building full product page twice is heavy; option: duplicate the 03 frame content as a flattened \"screenshot-like\" copy? I can clone the 03 frame subtree into 04 and add overlay + drawer. Cloning is easy via node.clone(). But clone doubles node count (fine). Then overlay black 40% and drawer on top. But careful with prototype: cloned nodes carry reactions? Reactions are not copied by clone? Actually clone copies reactions? I believe reactions are copied... not sure; to be safe, add overlay covering everything, and set links only on drawer controls; also overlay catches clicks visually. I'll strip reactions from clone children if any (clone happens before I add reactions to 03, or I can clear). Plan: build 03 fully without reactions, clone into 04, then add reactions to 03 + 04 drawer. Good.\n\nAlso 04 header cart shows count 1 → in the cloned header instance, override badge visible.\n\n05_Cart: header (no current, badge1), page title \"Shopping Cart\" + breadcrumb Home › Your Shopping Cart. Cart table: header row Product/Price/Quantity/Total; row: photo 100×100 + Denim Jacket + Color : Blue + Remove (underline, gray); $39.00; stepper −01+; $39.00. Cart total box right or below: gift wrap checkbox, Subtotal $39.00, Checkout black button. Newsletter + footer.\n\n06_Checkout: header (no current, badge1). Page title \"FASCO Checkout\". Two columns: left form (Contact: \"Contact\" + \"Don't have an account? Create Account\" link; Email Address field; Delivery: Country/Region select w/ chevron, First Name, Last Name, Address, City, Postal Code, checkbox \"Save This Info for future\"; Payment: \"Payment\", \"Credit Card\", Card Number w/ lock icon, Expiration Date, Security Code, Card Holder Name, checkbox save, \"Pay Now\" black button). Right: order summary card: photo + Denim Jacket Blue $39.00 qty badge 1; Discount code field + Apply button; rows Subtotal $39.00 / Shipping $40.00 / Total $79.00. Newsletter + footer.\n\n07_Sign_Up: 1920×1080 full screen: left photo panel Photo_Sign_Up (w 840 h 1080 crop), right card: FASCO wordmark + \"FASCO Terms & Conditions\" top right? Card: wordmark; social buttons row: \"Sign up with Google\" (Google logo), \"Sign up with Email\" (Gmail logo); \"OR\" divider; form: \"Create Account\" heading, fields First Name/Last Name (2-col), Email Address, Phone Number, Password, Confirm Password; \"Create Account\" black button; \"Already have an account? Login\". Also \"FASCO Terms & Conditions\" text (top-right of card area per original kit). \n\n08_Sign_In: photo left Photo_Sign_In; card: wordmark + Terms; \"Sign In To FASCO\"; social: \"Sign in with Google\" / \"Sign in with Email\"; OR; Email; Password; \"Sign In\" button; \"Register Now\" ghost? and \"Forgot Password?\" link.\n\n09_Forgot_Password: same shell, photo Photo_Sign_In; \"Forgot Password\"; First/Last name; Email; Phone; \"Send Confirmation Code\"; \"Already have an account? Login\". No social? Must-include has no social for 09-11. Card + Form + Media only.\n\n10_Confirmation_Code: \"Enter The Confirmation Code\"; Confirmation Code field; \"Recover Account\"; \"Didn't receive Confirmation Code? Resend Now\".\n\n11_New_Password: \"Enter Your New Password\"; New Password; Confirm Password; \"Submit\".\n\nAuth pages: no header/footer, 1920×1080, photo fills left half (crop fill), card white with shadow centered in right half? Or card floating over photo? Simpler classic FASCO: full-screen photo left, form panel right on white. Include \"FASCO Terms & Conditions\" top-right corner text.\n\nComponent count check \"Component reuse\": headers (2 comps), footers (2), newsletter, instagram strip, collection banner, features strip, deal slider, product cards (2 types), testimonial card, size box, swatch, qty stepper, checkbox, tag, stars row, social button, auth card shell?, page title/breadcrumb, countdown timer box, toolbar? (one-off ok), filter groups (one-off ok), pagination (one-off), mini cart drawer (one-off), cart table (one-off), gallery (one-off), buttons (2). Good enough.\n\nFonts to load: Volkhov Regular, Volkhov Bold; Poppins Regular, Medium, Semi Bold. Also given Button component uses Poppins Regular; Text Field uses Poppins Medium & Regular — same family, fine.\n\nIcon recolor: icon instances — override vector fills. Many icons have vector children with fills [] and strokes ink (chevron) vs fills ink (star). I'll write helper setIconColor(inst, hex) that walks descendants setting solid fills/strokes. Note: star icon used for rating (amber) AND wishlist (ink). Vector fills override on instance descendants is allowed (paints are overridable).\n\nPhoto placement: photo components are square-ish with IMAGE fill; to crop: instance.resize(w,h) stretches image? IMAGE fill default scaleMode FILL? The component fills: IMAGE — paint.scaleMode probably FILL. Resizing instance keeps crop-fill behavior if scaleMode is FILL. So I can resize instances to any aspect → image crops. \n\nApproach per photo usage: create instance, resize to target w/h, set cornerRadius, done. But resizing an