soft:'#F6F4EF',white:'#FFFFFF',red:'#D6372B',amber:'#F2A33C',blue:'#6F8FB0',lilac:'#C8A2C8'};\nconst rgb=h=>{const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return {r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255}};\nconst sol=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h),opacity:o});\nfunction T(p,chars,fam,style,size,color,ls=0){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:fam,style};t.fontSize=size;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[sol(color)];if(ls)t.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:ls};p.appendChild(t);return t}\nfunction Fr(p,w,h,fill){const f=figma.createFrame();f.resize(w,h);if(fill)f.fills=[sol(fill)];else f.fills=[];if(p)p.appendChild(f);return f}\nfunction AL(f,dir,gap,p=0,pt=p,pb=p,pl=p,pr=p){f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.paddingLeft=pl;f.paddingRight=pr;f.paddingTop=pt;f.paddingBottom=pb;return f}\n```\n\nWait padding signature messy. I'll do explicit sets.\n\nMedia instance helper:\n```js\nasync function Inst(p,id,w,h){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);return i}\nfunction paintIcon(inst,hex){for(const n of inst.findAll(x=>x.type==='VECTOR'||x.type==='BOOLEAN_OPERATION')){if(n.fills.length)n.fills=[sol(hex)];if(n.strokes.length)n.strokes=[sol(hex)]}}\n```\n\nNote: findAll on instance children — allowed (read), and setting fills on instance child is allowed override.\n\nComponents root: create frame \"⌘ FASCO · Local Components\" 1400 wide at (0,0). Components created via figma.createComponent() appended into it, positions tracked with a cursor; I'll lay them in a vertical flow manually with cursor y.\n\nReturn a JSON map of created component ids for later calls? Each call is separate; I can re-find by name: `page.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='...')`. Good — no need to persist.\n\nLet me also create text/paint styles? Optional; skip to save tokens. Actually \"define colors\" consistency via constants only.\n\nLet me write Call A now. Components in Call A:\n1. Btn/Outline (clone of But