e.\n\nOne concern: \"SALE\" red text — original uses outlined text. OK.\n\nNext: 02_Shop at x=2400+1920+240=4560? Set x=4560. Build with header/store, page title Fashion + breadcrumb, filters sidebar + toolbar + 9 product grid + pagination, collection banner, features, instagram, newsletter, footer/store.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4989fa14-2e7d-4d0d-bbb8-4573dd6d6ae6","uuid":"2288c314-578e-411f-9d6d-8a2eeb8f7921","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:25:41.753Z","thinking_duration_ms":16387}
